\begin{frame}[fragile]{Yue–Pinghua \scriptsize{Sung 2026}}
Amongst the many merits of Sung (2026):
\begin{itemize}
    \item criticisms of the subgrouping of Yue and Pinghua dialects in the LAC\\
    \item dealing with a very large number of features (no cherry-picking of which features should have more weighting)\\
    \item {[...]}
\end{itemize}
One criticism: Used the LAC's definition of Yue and Pinghua as a starting point. My questions are, e.g.\\
\begin{itemize}
    \item Why should the Sìyì dialects be considered Yue?\\
    \item Should some of the Hakka / Hakka-like dialects be considered Yue? (i.e. is the Yue-Hakka boundary as clear as assumed?)
\end{itemize}
\end{frame}

